OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvercast with periods of
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain at first. This
OL,7,Fclears late morning as largely dry and
OL,8,Foccasionally bright conditions feed
OL,9,Ffrom the west. Moderate to fresh
OL,10,Fbreezes turning to the northwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIsolated showers focused
OL,13,Fnorth of Lough Neagh, turning wintry
OL,14,Fto low levels. Most in south dry with
OL,15,Fclear spells and light winds bringing
OL,16,Fa frost to many come dawn.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FCold. Frosty start for many.
OL,19,FSunny spells. Most dry but showers in
OL,20,Ffar north during the morning. Higher
OL,21,Fcloud feeding from south for afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
