OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FThrough to mid-Thursday staying rather
OL,7,Fcloudy with showers or longer periods
OL,8,Fof rain. Turning dry and bright later
OL,9,FThursday.
